<item><title>Central African opposition gives government 14 days to meet demands</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-opposition-gives-government-14-days-to-meet-1b88be/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-opposition-gives-government-14-days-to-meet-1b88be/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>The BRDC coalition, which includes the former prime minister Martin Ziguélé, is demanding the release of detainees and lower fuel prices.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-opposition-gives-government-14-days-to-meet-1b88be/share.jpg" length="44926" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-opposition-gives-government-14-days-to-meet-1b88be/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
